3-05","order":433,"story_date":"2014-03-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":13,"quote":"I let them shackle me and did not fight.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=I%20let%20them%20shackle,and%20did%20not%20fight.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hero of Iroas","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-03-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=I%20let%20them%20shackle,and%20did%20not%20fight.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hero of Iroas\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"hero-iroas-2014-03-05-e4","era":null,"summary":"Aesrias is taken to a coliseum holding pen and realizes he is meant for illegal arena killing.","participants":["aesrias"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"major","page":"stories/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","order":433,"story_date":"2014-03-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"I would be sent to kill or die in an arena.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=I%20would%20be%20sent,die%20in%20an%20arena.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hero of Iroas","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-03-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=I%20would%20be%20sent,die%20in%20an%20arena.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hero of Iroas\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"hero-iroas-2014-03-05-e5","era":null,"summary":"Aesrias meets the star-skinned nyxborn in the next cell, who knew his mother.","participants":["aesrias","nyxborn-prisoner","aesrias-s-mother"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"major","page":"stories/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","order":433,"story_date":"2014-03-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":23,"quote":"I've heard your name and I know your mother.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=I%27ve%20heard%20your%20name,I%20know%20your%20mother.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hero of Iroas","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-03-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=I%27ve%20heard%20your%20name,I%20know%20your%20mother.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hero of Iroas\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"hero-iroas-2014-03-05-e6","era":null,"summary":"The nyxborn explains that it was sent to serve the governor but that Pilun no longer serves the true king, and it cannot free itself.","participants":["nyxborn-prisoner","pilun","anax"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"minor","page":"stories/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","order":433,"story_date":"2014-03-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":29,"quote":"this governor seems to no longer serve the true king.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=this%20governor%20seems%20to,serve%20the%20true%20king.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hero of Iroas","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-03-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=this%20governor%20seems%20to,serve%20the%20true%20king.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hero of Iroas\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"hero-iroas-2014-03-05-e7","era":null,"summary":"The nyxborn blesses Aesrias with Iroas's power, healing him and strengthening him before he faces sirens; Aesrias asks for candle wax for his ears.","participants":["nyxborn-prisoner","aesrias","iroas"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"major","page":"stories/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","order":433,"story_date":"2014-03-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":38,"quote":"He touched my shoulders. And I felt better. My wounds healed. I was no longer tired.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=He%20touched%20my%20shoulders.,was%20no%20longer%20tired.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hero of Iroas","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-03-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=He%20touched%20my%20shoulders.,was%20no%20longer%20tired.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hero of Iroas\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"hero-iroas-2014-03-05-e8","era":null,"summary":"Aesrias is led into the coliseum, where Pilun and a few spectators watch as nine chained sirens are released.","participants":["aesrias","pilun"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"minor","page":"stories/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","order":433,"story_date":"2014-03-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":45,"quote":"They all counted together, then released the sirens and ran to the arena's edge.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=They%20all%20counted%20together%2C,to%20the%20arena%27s%20edge.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hero of Iroas","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-03-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=They%20all%20counted%20together%2C,to%20the%20arena%27s%20edge.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hero of Iroas\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"hero-iroas-2014-03-05-e9","era":null,"summary":"Wax-deafened to their songs and protected by the blessing, Aesrias kills several sirens using their own chains.","participants":["aesrias"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"major","page":"stories/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","order":433,"story_date":"2014-03-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":48,"quote":"When the first siren tried to fly away in a panic, she choked her sister to death.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=When%20the%20first%20siren,her%20sister%20to%20death.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hero of Iroas","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-03-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=When%20the%20first%20siren,her%20sister%20to%20death.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hero of Iroas\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"hero-iroas-2014-03-05-e10","era":null,"summary":"Aesrias breaks the chain loop and is carried out of the coliseum and into the countryside by the remaining four sirens.","participants":["aesrias"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"major","page":"stories/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","order":433,"story_date":"2014-03-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":49,"quote":"I was able to easily break the links and held fast to the sirens.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=I%20was%20able%20to,fast%20to%20the%20sirens.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hero of Iroas","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-03-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hero-iroas-2014-03-05#:~:text=I%20was%20able%20to,fast%20to%20the%20sirens.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hero of Iroas\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"aesrias-e0","era":null,"summary":"Aesrias delivers harpy heads to Tynthal but Pilun accuses him of theft.","participants":["aesrias","pilun"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/aesrias","order":1050,"story_date":"","storyline":"Theros","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"Pilun accused him of stealing gold from a merchant","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Aesrias#:~:text=Pilun%20accused%20him%20of,gold%20from%20a%20merchant","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Aesrias","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Aesrias","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Aesrias#:~:text=Pilun%20accused%20him%20of,gold%20from%20a%20merchant","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Aesrias\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"aesrias-e1","era":null,"summary":"Aesrias is imprisoned below a coliseum and meets a Nyxborn follower of Iroas who heals him.","participants":["aesrias"],"location":"tynthal","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/aesrias","order":1050,"story_date":"","storyline":"Theros","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":4,"quote":"The Nyxborn healed Aesrias' wounds","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Aesrias#:~:text=The%20Nyxborn%20healed%20Aesrias%27%20wounds","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Aesrias","series"